kuṇḍataṭa-kuñjakuṭīra"},"title":["Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra"],"author":["by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["rādhākuṇḍataṭa-kuñjakuṭīra","govardhana-parvata, jāmuna-tīra"],"translation":["The grove-dwelling on the banks of Rādhā Kuṇḍa,\\","Govardhan mountain, the banks of River Yamunā;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["kusuma-sarovara, mānasa-gaṅgā","kalinda-nandinī vipula-taraṅgā"],"translation":["Kusuma-sarovar, Mānasa-gaṅgā,\\","the rolling waves of Yamunā, daughter of the sun;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vaṁśīvaṭa, gokula, dhīrasamīra","vṛndāvana-taru, latikā-vānīra"],"translation":["Place of the Rāsa Dance, and Gokula, the gentle breezes,\\","the trees, vines, and vetasa palms of Vraja;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["khaga-mṛgakula, malaya-bātāsa","mayura, bhramara, muralī-vilāsa"],"translation":["All the birds, deer, and animals, the sweet air of spring,\\","the peacocks, bumblebees, the flute’s sweet song;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["veṇu, śṛṇga, padachihna, meghamālā","vasanta, śaśāṅka, śaṅkha, karatālā"],"translation":["Flute, horn, His footsteps, range of clouds in the sky,\\","season of spring, the moon, the conch, the hand-cymbals;"],"isLong":false},{"number":"6","text":["jugala vilāse anukūla jāni","līlā-vilāsa-uddīpaka māni"],"translation":["I know all these things are nourishing the Pastimes of the Divine Couple, I can feel they arouse the holy Pastimes of the Lord."],"isLong":false},{"number":"7","text":["e saba choḍata kā̐hā nāhi jāu̐","e saba choḍata parāṇa hārāu̐"],"translation":["I can never leave all these things so dear to me,\\","without them I know I’ll surely die."],"isLong":false},{"number":"8","text":["bhaktivinoda kahe, śuna kāna","tuyā uddīpaka hāmārā parāṇa"],"translation":["Hear me, O Kāna, says Śrī Bhakti Vinod,\\","You are the only light of my life."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.R. Sridhar Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/sridhar-maharaj-and-govinda-5","personSlug":"srila-b-r-sridhar-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/krsnachaitanya-das/36-radha-kunda-tata-5","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Kamal Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/jayasri-sound/32-radhakundatata-kunjakutira","personSlug":"kamal-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/radha-kundatata","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en/radhakundatata-kunjakutira/","description":"Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Kirtan Guide.","title":"Rādhā-kuṇḍataṭa-kuñja-kuṭīra. by Śrīla Bhakti Vinod Ṭhākur | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"en","slug":"radhakundatata-kunjakutira"}}